{"name":"Ottoman","hex":"#d3dbcb","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Ottoman","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["Archaic form of Osman, the name borne by"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A member of the Ottoman dynasty.","A citizen of the Ottoman Empire."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Ottoman"}],"entries":[{"title":"Osman I","blocks":[{"text":"Osman I or Osman Ghazi was the eponymous founder of the Ottoman Empire. While initially a small Turkoman principality during Osman's lifetime, his beylik transformed into a vast empire in the centuries after his death. It existed until 1922 shortly after the end of World War I, when the sultanate was abolished."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/I_Osman.jpg/330px-I_Osman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osman_I"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/I_Osman.jpg/500px-I_Osman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/I_Osman.jpg/500px-I_Osman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AI_Osman.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Paolo_Veronese_%28Nachfolger%29_-_Sultan_Osman_I._-_2242_-_Bavarian_State_Painting_Collections.jpg/500px-Paolo_Veronese_%28Nachfolger%29_-_Sultan_Osman_I._-_2242_-_Bavarian_State_Painting_Collections.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Paolo_Veronese_%28Nachfolger%29_-_Sultan_Osman_I._-_2242_-_Bavarian_State_Painting_Collections.jpg/1280px-Paolo_Veronese_%28Nachfolger%29_-_Sultan_Osman_I._-_2242_-_Bavarian_State_Painting_Collections.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=p